# Distribution archives.
#
# couchbase-admin-mcp-server.zip is the ORIGINAL upstream snapshot this work started
# from, kept in this folder for reference. It contains its own .git directory, so
# tracking it inside this repository would nest a repo inside a repo and confuse both
# tooling and anyone reading the tree. The history it holds is already here: this
# repository descends from those commits.
*.zip
